### Funciona direto no IntelliJ (HTTP Client). Suba a API antes: ./gradlew bootRun

### Criar conta
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nubank", "type": "CHECKING", "initialBalance": 1500.00 }

### Listar contas
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts

### Buscar conta
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/1

### Atualizar conta
PUT http://localhost:8080/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nubank PJ", "type": "CHECKING", "initialBalance": 2000.00 }

### Remover conta
DELETE http://localhost:8080/accounts/1

### Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mercado", "type": "EXPENSE" }

### Listar categorias (filtro opcional por tipo)
GET http://localhost:8080/categories?type=EXPENSE

### Validação: deve retornar 400
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "type": "CHECKING" }

### Duplicada: deve retornar 409 (rode o POST de categoria duas vezes)
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mercado", "type": "EXPENSE" }
